                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For the text of the address delivered by President Truman in Groton, Connecticut,
                    at the keel laying of the U.S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Nautilus</hi>, the
                    first nuclear-powered submarine, June 14, 1952, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Public Papers</hi>
                    <pb facs="0168" n="982" xml:id="pg982"/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">of the Presidents of the United States: Harry S. Truman,
                        1952–53</hi>, pages 425–429.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
